  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.167` to `4.1.169`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.167...application_builder_helpers/4.1.169)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): classify external aborts during post-success lifetime cleanup (Fixes #749) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/757\n* fix(cli): classify external aborts on the command-first success path (Fixes #748) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/754\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.155 to 0.3.156 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/758\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.50 to 9.0.51 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/759\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261021103220.2e89362...build.20261022103316.b58fd1b",
